{"text": "what time works for you", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "short", "words": 5, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.14, "jev:none:ms": 245.729791931808, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 165.02108296845108, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.6470943286149003, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.46395896282047, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.29647767543792725, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 198.49862495902926}
{"text": "can you please switch the display to dark mode and dim it a bit", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 14, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 215.78412503004074, "jev:editor:p": 0.59, "jev:editor:ms": 209.68691702000797, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9997323659055611, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.96924995724112, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9979235705245811, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.96154100354761}
{"text": "I want to change my keyboard layout to German", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 9, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 1.0, "jev:none:ms": 167.99770796205848, "jev:editor:p": 0.5, "jev:editor:ms": 189.0836670063436, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9953510037299484, "d3-lite:none:ms": 114.3848750507459, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.8485208063436035, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.12699993606657}
{"text": "could you open the privacy settings so I can check microphone access", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.98, "jev:none:ms": 223.81516708992422, "jev:editor:p": 0.38, "jev:editor:ms": 155.85304202977568, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9986530162927763, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.09762504324317, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.987166975182647, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.2764579532668}
{"text": "switch over to the agent that is working on the release pipeline", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.97, "jev:none:ms": 187.56133306305856, "jev:editor:p": 0.24, "jev:editor:ms": 162.4001250602305, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9971113708739093, "d3-lite:none:ms": 114.71612495370209, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9728785429022799, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 193.97199992090464}
{"text": "take a screenshot of the current window and save it to the capture folder", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 14, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.97, "jev:none:ms": 167.67966700717807, "jev:editor:p": 0.34, "jev:editor:ms": 164.77999999187887, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.988877557632418, "d3-lite:none:ms": 191.39279192313552, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9805230187831608, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.89279198274016}
{"text": "please turn the volume down, it is way too loud right now", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.98, "jev:none:ms": 150.18754196353257, "jev:editor:p": 0.49, "jev:editor:ms": 255.31562499236315, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9978089229342328, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.40583297796547, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9815104007720947, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 119.75741607602686}
{"text": "show me the issues that are still open for the ctx bar", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 168.00424992106855, "jev:editor:p": 0.23, "jev:editor:ms": 170.1071250718087, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9810018897931565, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.23537503369153, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9230879270110152, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.68087504990399}
{"text": "go back one level and pick the second option instead", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 10, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 235.99837499205023, "jev:editor:p": 0.78, "jev:editor:ms": 190.25766698177904, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9947290093145718, "d3-lite:none:ms": 119.79237501509488, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9789905140112939, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 122.02395789790899}
{"text": "The meeting went well and we agreed to ship the first version next week.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 14, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.0, "jev:none:ms": 260.9540830599144, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 163.54074992705137, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.008422980006570182, "d3-lite:none:ms": 192.72729195654392, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.01844250424535948, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.79604193381965}
{"text": "I think the new layout looks much cleaner than the previous one, nice work.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 14, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.04, "jev:none:ms": 153.99725001771003, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 251.17291591595858, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.0668960034744738, "d3-lite:none:ms": 119.37179206870496, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.30413685155322706, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 123.74554108828306}
{"text": "We still need to decide who owns the speaker verification before we start.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 13, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.1, "jev:none:ms": 160.3472080314532, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 177.39279102534056, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.20375155216085244, "d3-lite:none:ms": 119.00862504262477, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.14544149799819298, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.05604095570743}
{"text": "My train was delayed by forty minutes, so I will join the call a bit later.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 16, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 229.82912498991936, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 160.23545805364847, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.034922229865359505, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.69295907672495, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.03275853920856973, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.15274995751679}
{"text": "The results from yesterday look promising, but the sample size is still small.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 13, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 160.8685419196263, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 162.09191596135497, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.043228720510754895, "d3-lite:none:ms": 120.5811669351533, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.13590454245182618, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.82075005955994}
{"text": "Could we move the review to Thursday afternoon instead of Wednesday?", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.65, "jev:none:ms": 234.20641699340194, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 156.77166695240885, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9272743947127519, "d3-lite:none:ms": 121.33316695690155, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.35525538654657524, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 196.91004196647555}
{"text": "Honestly I did not expect the latency to be this low on the small model.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 15, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.04, "jev:none:ms": 158.03270798642188, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 166.07608401682228, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.36326098442077637, "d3-lite:none:ms": 200.66975010558963, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.5966989398002625, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.71687497477978}
{"text": "Let me know if you have any questions about the proposal.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "long", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.06, "jev:none:ms": 141.30512496922165, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 170.47254100907594, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.1610124111175537, "d3-lite:none:ms": 121.0652079898864, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.04885410136387507, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 119.13887492846698}
{"text": "Please send me the report by Friday.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 7, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.21, "jev:none:ms": 163.55258296243846, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 167.59329102933407, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.34145981073379517, "d3-lite:none:ms": 115.11800007428974, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.10652273893356323, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 115.90395902749151}
{"text": "Turn left at the second traffic light and park behind the building.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.55, "jev:none:ms": 245.4733329359442, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 169.2568330327049, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.36454645885665593, "d3-lite:none:ms": 114.69862493686378, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.3986336768080688, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 114.79091690853238}
{"text": "Open the window if it gets too warm in the lab.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.29, "jev:none:ms": 170.40758300572634, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 163.70462498161942, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9899220460606841, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.42795799020678, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9717596517194684, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 197.65362504404038}
{"text": "Remember to lock the door when you leave.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.21, "jev:none:ms": 150.62362502794713, "jev:editor:p": 0.02, "jev:editor:ms": 190.81499997992069, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.0944204465386205, "d3-lite:none:ms": 180.13274995610118, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.03274991290085212, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.600666009821}
{"text": "Restart the server before the demo, otherwise it will be slow.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.32, "jev:none:ms": 167.12687502149493, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 240.60825002379715, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.982570014504418, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.04179102182388, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.8619642725294192, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 122.2032920923084}
{"text": "Switch off the lights in the meeting room after you are done.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.43, "jev:none:ms": 165.64095905050635, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 166.7334579396993, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9457069388778934, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.14466703031212, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.731547019825787, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.45750002935529}
{"text": "Delete the old drafts, we do not need them anymore.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 10, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.81, "jev:none:ms": 243.34929196629673, "jev:editor:p": 0.3, "jev:editor:ms": 157.39037503954023, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.7334595918655396, "d3-lite:none:ms": 121.21279200073332, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.4932948652926168, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.76633297652006}
{"text": "Mute your microphone when you are not speaking.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.25, "jev:none:ms": 166.18670895695686, "jev:editor:p": 0.02, "jev:editor:ms": 161.54987493064255, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9289660453796387, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.87854200135916, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.620085597038269, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 115.5179999768734}
{"text": "it is too bright in here", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 6, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 428.02266601938754, "jev:editor:p": 0.19, "jev:editor:ms": 185.5077079962939, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.989698911450283, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.80574999283999, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9697406147485885, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.2935840440914}
{"text": "I can barely hear anything", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 5, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.89, "jev:none:ms": 169.41733297426254, "jev:editor:p": 0.13, "jev:editor:ms": 154.78570898994803, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.33108995351463416, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.24416608922184, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.428361015666693, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.17404197063297}
{"text": "my screen is way too dark", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 6, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 162.4650420853868, "jev:editor:p": 0.24, "jev:editor:ms": 235.92941602692008, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9942212884846634, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.1178329968825, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9752561177521166, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.51637498289347}
{"text": "I need some quiet for the next hour", "label": "command", "lang": "en", "group": "hard", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.75, "jev:none:ms": 169.24783308058977, "jev:editor:p": 0.05, "jev:editor:ms": 171.52658302802593, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.8630324602127075, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.81491704843938, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.7037210850798761, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.9059169953689}
{"text": "He told me to lock the screen whenever I leave my desk.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "quoted", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 226.20883292984217, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 160.10537499096245, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.06017979099944701, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.65641702711582, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.31006179183905697, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.07487497571856}
{"text": "She said turn on dark mode, it is easier on the eyes.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "quoted", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.1, "jev:none:ms": 156.2680839560926, "jev:editor:p": 0.03, "jev:editor:ms": 193.6123330378905, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.3274442753957428, "d3-lite:none:ms": 170.56912498082966, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.7153251767158508, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 125.3043330507353}
{"text": "The manual says to restart the computer after the update.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "quoted", "words": 10, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 181.89441703725606, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 216.99041698593646, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.6109504517629608, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.29945899080485, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.3595215892506593, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.42108298838139}
{"text": "Tell Paul that the volume button is broken again.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "en", "group": "quoted", "words": 9, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.14, "jev:none:ms": 163.34241698496044, "jev:editor:p": 0.07, "jev:editor:ms": 149.22079094685614, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.24200700584064433, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.55199998151511, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.06514090687876385, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.9088749922812}
