{"text": "mach bitte die Lautstärke leiser, das ist gerade viel zu laut", "label": "command", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 241.76199990324676, "jev:editor:p": 0.64, "jev:editor:ms": 170.60008400585502, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9952155727019819, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.5430419864133, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9730613358531693, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.48083291947842}
{"text": "zeig mir die offenen Issues für die ctx bar", "label": "command", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 9, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "command", "jev:none:p": 0.96, "jev:none:ms": 160.62729107216, "jev:editor:p": 0.19, "jev:editor:ms": 164.61533308029175, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9552202714023709, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.00554105825722, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9303202102357164, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 201.98449993040413}
{"text": "Das Meeting lief gut und wir haben beschlossen, die erste Version nächste Woche auszuliefern.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 14, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.0, "jev:none:ms": 168.3521670056507, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 171.1937499931082, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.025493872655258865, "d3-lite:none:ms": 185.99087500479072, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.0457865213054451, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 127.63733288738877}
{"text": "Ich finde das neue Layout viel aufgeräumter als das alte, gute Arbeit.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.02, "jev:none:ms": 201.40900008846074, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 193.453666055575, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.16266891845074052, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.65404203813523, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.4328938891621265, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 121.03079108055681}
{"text": "Mein Zug hatte vierzig Minuten Verspätung, ich komme etwas später in den Call.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 13, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 288.7280840659514, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 203.43737490475178, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.021553321171514487, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.7864999519661, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.037640404877036446, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 197.8165830951184}
{"text": "Die Ergebnisse von gestern sehen vielversprechend aus, aber die Stichprobe ist noch klein.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 13, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 166.1942919017747, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 171.8949159840122, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.04095997212529234, "d3-lite:none:ms": 189.01979108341038, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.20044012069046319, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 120.2755420235917}
{"text": "Können wir das Review auf Donnerstagnachmittag verschieben?", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 7, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.54, "jev:none:ms": 167.4999580718577, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 234.80733309406787, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9534766113515072, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.18229197524488, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.7074197145527517, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.22237507253885}
{"text": "Sag mir Bescheid, wenn du Fragen zum Vorschlag hast.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "long", "words": 9, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.19, "jev:none:ms": 165.21250002551824, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 176.13250005524606, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.13049845591930234, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.42745893914253, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.048767980369806216, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.24974990263581}
{"text": "Schick mir bitte den Bericht bis Freitag.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 7, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.31, "jev:none:ms": 149.99983401503414, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 231.63075000047684, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.09182209453119267, "d3-lite:none:ms": 119.84054208733141, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.09978622198104858, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 117.43874999228865}
{"text": "Mach das Fenster auf, wenn es im Labor zu warm wird.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.45, "jev:none:ms": 160.7931669568643, "jev:editor:p": 0.02, "jev:editor:ms": 163.819000008516, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9546142122320792, "d3-lite:none:ms": 129.2227089870721, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.8263016116455918, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 120.17858400940895}
{"text": "Denk daran, die Tür abzuschließen, wenn du gehst.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.1, "jev:none:ms": 231.0563330538571, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 169.96387497056276, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.25799649953842163, "d3-lite:none:ms": 118.97208297159523, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.12854105234146118, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 195.52258297335356}
{"text": "Starte den Server vor der Demo neu, sonst ist er langsam.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.32, "jev:none:ms": 157.58779097814113, "jev:editor:p": 0.01, "jev:editor:ms": 170.84112495649606, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9908022908236895, "d3-lite:none:ms": 196.03970798198134, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9240823594648173, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 115.40887504816055}
{"text": "Lösch die alten Entwürfe, die brauchen wir nicht mehr.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 9, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.89, "jev:none:ms": 169.64774997904897, "jev:editor:p": 0.28, "jev:editor:ms": 158.6158749414608, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.4228541851043701, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.2710830103606, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.4973136336411943, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.03708402253687}
{"text": "Schalte dein Mikrofon stumm, wenn du nicht sprichst.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.6, "jev:none:ms": 279.21841596253216, "jev:editor:p": 0.04, "jev:editor:ms": 180.36112503614277, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.8883682754498617, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.04591603484005, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.525676520209105, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.67991697322577}
{"text": "es ist viel zu hell hier", "label": "command", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 6, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 310.8496660133824, "jev:editor:p": 0.1, "jev:editor:ms": 167.85783297382295, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9950842534703999, "d3-lite:none:ms": 154.4482089811936, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9811803819412553, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 114.67345803976059}
{"text": "ich höre kaum etwas", "label": "command", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 4, "base:length<=4": "command", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.85, "jev:none:ms": 161.71291598584503, "jev:editor:p": 0.05, "jev:editor:ms": 246.77620804868639, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.11077407334841514, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.14379105251282, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.2549924850463867, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.59366602543741}
{"text": "mein Bildschirm ist viel zu dunkel", "label": "command", "lang": "de", "group": "hard", "words": 6, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.99, "jev:none:ms": 186.22562498785555, "jev:editor:p": 0.2, "jev:editor:ms": 251.7586670583114, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.9856548675881962, "d3-lite:none:ms": 116.89699999988079, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.9781934868811141, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 116.10716697759926}
{"text": "Er hat gesagt, ich soll den Bildschirm sperren, wenn ich weggehe.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "quoted", "words": 11, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.01, "jev:none:ms": 176.69387499336153, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 162.33125003054738, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.10311612179529304, "d3-lite:none:ms": 117.58370907045901, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.4258279033251972, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 208.8082500267774}
{"text": "Im Handbuch steht, man soll den Rechner nach dem Update neu starten.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "quoted", "words": 12, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.02, "jev:none:ms": 164.23341701738536, "jev:editor:p": 0.0, "jev:editor:ms": 161.2157910130918, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.820233190662658, "d3-lite:none:ms": 198.25091701932251, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.6541475057601929, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 118.17541706841439}
{"text": "Sag Paul, dass die Lautstärketaste wieder kaputt ist.", "label": "dictation", "lang": "de", "group": "quoted", "words": 8, "base:length<=4": "dictation", "base:lexical": "dictation", "jev:none:p": 0.19, "jev:none:ms": 159.97645899187773, "jev:editor:p": 0.03, "jev:editor:ms": 248.10874997638166, "d3-lite:none:p": 0.6549046440450953, "d3-lite:none:ms": 121.60041695460677, "d3-lite:editor:p": 0.44593125581741333, "d3-lite:editor:ms": 119.73695911001414}
